---
description: Mandatory universal engineering and drift-control policy for this monorepo
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and enforce, before planning, generating or reviewing any code:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/governance/engineering-directive.md`
- `docs/governance/project-registry.yaml`

Reuse order: existing platform/model capability → existing deterministic
kernel → thin adapter → new subsystem only under an approved exception in
`docs/governance/architecture-exceptions.yaml`.

Classify affected paths through the registry (longest-literal-prefix-wins) and
load only the applicable project directives from `docs/governance/projects/`.

Probabilistic output must never own money, authorization, tenant identity,
irreversible state transitions, approval enforcement, send eligibility,
signing, persistence, audit or rollback.

Every substantive change carries a Capability Reuse Map (universal directive
§9). More custom code is not progress; the smallest working vertical
integration is.
